    "pages": [
      "<div style=\"min-height:100vh;background:#f4f5f7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;padding:32px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:480px;width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)\">\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">Projects</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#d1d5db\">&gt;</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#111827;font-weight:600\">Delete Mum</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin-bottom:6px\">What deleting \"Mum\" changes</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:22px;line-height:1.5\">These rules will be removed. Messages already delivered are not affected — this only changes what happens going forward.</div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:26px\">\n      <label style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;color:#6b7280;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.03em;margin-bottom:8px\">RULES THAT WILL BE DELETED (2)</label>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#374151\"><b>Mike</b> - Contact</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:700\">Deleted</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7f1d1d\">Future messages from Mike will not be assigned to this project.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#374151\"><b>Mum's Chat</b> - Group</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:700\">Deleted</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7f1d1d\">Future messages from Mum's Chat in this group will not be assigned to this project.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:10px\">Once a rule is deleted, future signals from that sender/group are unassigned again, the same as before any rule existed for them. Signals already assigned or notified stay exactly as they are - this never changes history.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;background:#fff;color:#374151;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Cancel</div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;background:#b91c1c;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Continue to Delete</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
    ],
